ing_Summer_Face.webp\nhttps://static.wikia.nocookie.net/feheroes_gamepedia_en/images/c/cb/Freyja_Fleeting_Summer_Mini_Unit_Transform.png\nしかし、人形はFrojiのヤギの変身ではなく、Freyjaのヤギの変身です。\nhttps://static.wikia.nocookie.net/feheroes_gamepedia_en/images/1/1b/Freyja_Lady_of_Nightmare_Transform_Mini_Unit_Idle.png\n\nhttps://static.wikia.nocookie.net/fireemblem/images/5/51/Book_IV_Ending_Movie_6.png", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@youheiogm/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1255350, "client_id": 1332241, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1c4c0c26/uploads/origins/f02b3873-b8b3-4111-8db6-82ae49e2e387?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=83562b4a8d986e33ac60029ffb7a46fe", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1c4c0c26/uploads/origins/f02b3873-b8b3-4111-8db6-82ae49e2e387?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=83562b4a8d986e33ac60029ffb7a46fe, https://si.imgix.net/1c4c0c26/uploads/origins/f02b3873-b8b3-4111-8db6-82ae49e2e387?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5cd5659f2deef2398b9dafd893db8338 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1c4c0c26/uploads/origins/f02b3873-b8b3-4111-8db6-82ae49e2e387?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b7c5f12993bca6d7bb05607f6c06c9dd 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1c4c0c26/uploads/origins/f02b3873-b8b3-4111-8db6-82ae49e2e387?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0ca5b1364a5c112678f5035d62b9e438", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1c4c0c26/uploads/origins/f02b3873-b8b3-4111-8db6-82ae49e2e387?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0ca5b1364a5c112678f5035d62b9e438, https:/